  "body": "Auction: 2/2 Dunrobin Place, Highland Park (Branch office) on Tuesday 8 December 2026 at 2:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nAn exceptional opportunity for developers, investors and land bankers in Half Moon Bay!\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Half Moon Bay's most sought-after locations with sea views, this substantial 1,014m² freehold property comes with Resource Consent (RC) approved for 8 houses, offering exciting development potential in a premium coastal neighbourhood of Half Moon Bay and zoned for Macleans College.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n• 1,014m² Freehold Land – Substantial section in a desirable location.\r\n• RC Approved for 8 Houses – A fantastic opportunity for developers.\r\n• Mixed Housing Suburban Zone – Under the Auckland Unitary Plan.\r\n• Beautiful Sea Views – Enjoy an elevated outlook towards Half Moon Bay.\r\n• Excellent School Zones – Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Pigeon Mountain Primary.\r\n• Prime Coastal Location – Just a short walk to Half Moon Bay Marina, supermarkets, shops, cafés and restaurants.\r\n\r\nLocation, Lifestyle & Future Potential\r\nEnjoy the convenience of living just minutes from Half Moon Bay Marina, with regular ferry services to Auckland's CBD. Excellent schools, local shopping and coastal amenities make this an outstanding location for families and future homeowners.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking to develop, invest, landbank or enjoy the existing home, this property presents a rare combination of location, lifestyle and development potential.\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this are hard to find! Contact us today for more information, RC documentation or to arrange a private viewing.\r\n\r\nDevelopment remains subject to the approved RC conditions and any other necessary consents and approvals.",
